From d425bf157805285524457cf900caf49564dfe72a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fuzailmansuri <mfm9875@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:15:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Add native DynamicBar configuration preferences

Introduce dedicated DynamicBar settings under Display to configure
status bar island presentation, keyguard chips, and event dispatch.

- Implement DynamicBar preference controller and fragment under Display.
- Register with BaseSearchIndexProvider for native Settings search indexing.
- Use SettingsEnums.DISPLAY for standardized AOSP metrics logging.
- Add toggles for media, charging, timers, alarms, and notifications.
- Define preferences layout, localized strings, and resource bindings.

Change-Id: I9740ca71bc3f997adaef15c86479ab66c1e3a43d
---
 AndroidManifest.xml                           |  16 ++
 res/values/arrays.xml                         |  13 ++
 res/values/strings.xml                        |  51 ++++
 res/xml/display_settings.xml                  |   7 +
 res/xml/dynamic_bar_settings.xml              | 143 ++++++++++++
 src/com/android/settings/Settings.java        |   1 +
 .../android/settings/display/DynamicBar.kt    | 220 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../DynamicBarPreferenceController.java       |  41 ++++
 8 files changed, 492 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 res/xml/dynamic_bar_settings.xml
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/display/DynamicBar.kt
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/display/DynamicBarPreferenceController.java

